# Sunspine Lynx: "Players can't gain life" is a static ability, so it applies only while the Lynx is on the battlefield
# (CR 604.1, 611.3a). On turn 2, under Bot1's Lynx, Bot2's Lightning Helix deals 3 to Bot1 but gains Bot2 nothing (17 / 20).
# Bot2's Swords to Plowshares then exiles the Lynx, and "its controller gains life equal to its power": the Lynx has left by
# then, so Bot1 gains 5 (22). A second Helix the same turn gains Bot2 its 3 (Bot1 19, Bot2 23).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Sunspine Lynx
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Lightning Helix
Swords to Plowshares
Lightning Helix
Island
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sunspine Lynx.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Helix.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Sunspine Lynx)
? Bot1.Life = 17
? Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot1.Life = 22
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Helix.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Life = 23
Exile = Sunspine Lynx
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Helix; Swords to Plowshares; Lightning Helix; Black Lotus
